 device.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="TODENTJ-3-55_F1"/></fig><table-wrap id="T1" position="float"><label>Table 1.</label><caption><p>Fatigue Resistance (Mean Number of Cycles to Failure and SD) of Size 25, Taper.06 Instruments</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" width="100%"><thead><tr><th rowspan="2" colspan="1">Instruments</th><th colspan="2" rowspan="1">NCF</th><th colspan="2" rowspan="1">Fragment Length</th></tr><tr><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Mean</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">SD</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">Mean</th><th rowspan="1" colspan="1">SD</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">TF 25.06 </td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">770,01 <xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="T1FN1">*</xref></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">123,77</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5,29 <xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="T1FN3">&#x003be;</xref></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0,40</td></tr><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">M2 25.06</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">492,51 </td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">91,54</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5,33 <xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="T1FN3">&#x003be;</xref></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0,25</td></tr><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">FlexMast 25.06</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">555,83 </td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">83,47</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4,58 <xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="T1FN3">&#x003be;</xref></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0,56</td></tr><tr><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Profile 25.06</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">564,00 </td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">22,71</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5,00 <xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="T1FN3">&#x003be;</xref></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0,58</td></tr></tbo